ked-solution "To plot $y=-\\frac{6}{x},$ we apply the following steps:\n\n- Take the curve $y=-\\frac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/d5/d5d93e12275c683e0a56f0ec9a0c99540a7774879cd0f8fa69151ddba68a44fa.png)\n\n- Stretch the result by a scale factor of $6$ parallel to the $y$-axis to get the graph of $y=-\\frac{6}{x}.$\n\n![](images/c5/c525edcf937bfdc311acd0d7cac778802e1939dc2bd61fd3a5bf58f808712220.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186386668 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068779 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4640f978-9caa-5960-bec4-f153a1b4cc5d" :knowledge-point/title "Graphing a Transformed Reciprocal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "92c55780-5247-5ab6-a621-d40a0527133d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ed/edb61b0239e926ae983d0cb67ffb05c7ff0b452564e6972dfa15cf0f2472a727.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186386670} {:answer/id #uuid "96e6fd33-b036-50c8-a86d-2ed4364a0dc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/65/65e24bd4cadacd7510d9dc529d13d02a40445abba54129a7f5801c75dd0e2da9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186386671} {:answer/id #uuid "46d1074a-2a76-523e-ac49-c7030b1d984d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6c/6c4c728e59e416a589b85318988a3a87e2a3c9445b669c4091301b21254c87fa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186386672} {:answer/id #uuid "50a3028f-ed6c-5718-a36a-947dbee62ad0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/46/4612933db2d25ce80b7e7258d3e381fd03f951246b515c3c34c69b71c537c7fc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186386673} {:answer/id #uuid "71df20dc-d7fc-5b41-be17-a6983196a882" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d1/d14d6a75f24afea6dfe31aed9dc752b470c6d672b6a3c0f97820738b6140e629.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186386674}] :answer-field/correct {:an